WEBVTT

00:00:02.359 --> 00:00:04.789
<v><b>Director:</b></v> OK. Be quiet, please.

00:00:05.066 --> 00:00:06.746
Scene one, take one.

00:00:07.013 --> 00:00:10.866
Lights, camera... action!

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.173
<v><b>Daisy:</b></v> Hello, Sam.

00:00:17.631 --> 00:00:18.519
<v><b>Sam:</b></v> Hello, Daisy.

00:00:19.368 --> 00:00:20.925
<v><b>Daisy:</b></v> Come in. Sit down.

00:00:21.715 --> 00:00:23.142
We need to talk.

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:26.055
<v><b>Sam:</b></v> Talk? What about?

00:00:26.835 --> 00:00:29.120
<v><b>Daisy:</b></v> Us. You and me.

00:00:29.705 --> 00:00:32.605
<v><b>Sam:</b></v> Listen to me, Daisy. I love you!

00:00:33.276 --> 00:00:34.265
Do you love me?

00:00:35.498 --> 00:00:38.737
<v><b>Daisy:</b></v> I don’t know, Sam. I need time.

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:39.859
<v><b>Sam:</b></v> And Paul?

00:00:40.788 --> 00:00:41.647
Do you love him?

00:00:41.805 --> 00:00:43.833
<v><b>Daisy:</b></v> Don’t talk about Paul.

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:48.168
Yes, I like Paul, but I don’t love him.

00:00:48.433 --> 00:00:50.447
You don’t understand.

00:00:53.348 --> 00:00:57.292
<v><b>Sam:</b></v> Don’t cry, Daisy. Please don’t cry.

00:00:57.565 --> 00:01:01.807
<v><b>Director:</b></v> Cut! Great! I like it.

00:01:10.041 --> 00:01:11.543
<v><b>Director:</b></v> OK. Scene two.

00:01:11.747 --> 00:01:15.680
This is a big scene, Daisy, go to the windows.

00:01:17.963 --> 00:01:18.494
Open them.

00:01:23.186 --> 00:01:26.245
Sam, go to Daisy, stand next to her.

00:01:27.472 --> 00:01:31.784
Daisy, look at him. That’s great. Don’t move.

00:01:32.814 --> 00:01:35.960
<v><b>Sam:</b></v> What do I say to her? I don’t remember.

00:01:35.985 --> 00:01:36.657
<v><b>Director:</b></v> Nothing.

00:01:36.775 --> 00:01:41.745
Don’t say anything. Just take her hands and look into her eyes.

00:01:44.887 --> 00:01:47.059
That’s it! Cut!